            "review_text": "Macejkovic G\nSherrills Ford, North Carolina4 contributions\n0\nfast service\nSep 2022\nQuality Food, The Burgers Are Delicious and So Are Their Fries.\nOrdered me a Hawaiian Burger and it was great, 9/10\nThe Pineapple Was The Best Part To It! The teriyaki Sauce was messy but still good.\nThe Fries were also good and had a unique texture to them.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 25, 2022",
