            "review_title": "Review at Com Bac Ca Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Robyn M\nLincoln, United Kingdom18 contributions\n0\nAbsolutely amazing!\nApr 2017\nWe went here 10 days into our trip to Vietnam, after it was recommended by our Air BnB host.\nSo far my partner and I had been a little disappointed by the Vietnamese food that we had tried. However... After visiting here we were blown away!! Finally some real, authentic, beautiful and refined Vietnamese food! It was perfect and the selection on the menu was great. \nAs for the service; our waiter was kind, funny, had really good English and made some brilliant suggestions, of things that otherwise we wouldn't have tried, and would therefore have missed out on. \nAnd as for the price... It was an absolute bargain! For 2 main dishes, rice, a beautiful vegetable dish, a pudding and drinks, the bill came to 250,000dong.\nPerfection in a quaint setting.\nRead more\nWritten April 3, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
